# Local planning notes
IMPROVEMENTS.md

# Where to deploy (host, path, URL) lives here, never in the repo.
# deploy.sh itself is versioned and reads it; see deploy.env.example.
deploy.env

# The CLI's targets (bin/kronos.py) live here, never in the repo; see kronos.env.example.
# backups/ holds the safety snapshots it takes before a write to prod.
kronos.env
backups/
kronos_backup_*.json

CLAUDE.md

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
# Kept as the literal line `graft/` that `graft build` looks for, or it
# re-appends its own copy after every build. It matches at any depth, so the
# skill it installs needs an explicit way back in:
graft/
!.claude/skills/graft/
